      ],
      "description": "<p>The hell hound breathes flames that deal <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">3d6</span> fire damage to all creatures in a 15 foot cone (DC 17 basic Reflex save).</p>\n<p>The hell hound can't use Breath Weapon again for <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> rounds. If the hell hound would take fire damage or be targeted by a fire effect, its Breath Weapon recharges.</p>",
